  "description": "The Echo Solo features a welded steel frame with Cromoly front triangle for fine handling and great looks. Equipped with a stylish Creme alluminium crankset and 16-speed Shimano drivetrain controlled by modern Shimano Claris STI shifters. Clearance for up to 37mm tyres with fenders. You will find some nice touches such as polished rims and a classic 1” quill stem. Front rack compatible with a comfy Creme saddle. Finished in a high-end multi layer gloss paint in light gray. This bike is the ideal choice for anyone who wants to get a first taste of how good road cycling can be.",
